    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d120">

                <pb facs="0274" n="178" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg178"/>

                <head>No. 120.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wing to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Quito,
                                Ecuador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-04-02"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 2, 1872</date>.
                        (Received May 18.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 211.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have recently received many gratifying
                    proofs of the warm feeling existing here toward our Government, in all
                    circles.</p>
                <p>President Moreno and his ministers have been especially pleased with the uniform
                    kindness and courtesy which Minister Flores has received from President Grant
                    and your excellency.</p>
                <p>I think I may truly say that our Government does not stand more highly and
                    affectionately in the estimation of any people than it does among the
                    Ecuadorians to-day.</p>
                <p>Public sentiment favors us, and Americans are being employed in almost all the
                    walks of industry and improvement. This state of affairs has resulted during the
                    past two or three years, and is in marked contrast to the former prestige of our
                    Government and people here.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>RUMSEY WING.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
